OL,3,GNEWSA'Devastating' fire at fish and
OL,4,Achip shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fish and chip shop in Bridlington
OL,7,Fsuffered extensive damage after a fire
OL,8,Fbroke out on Saturday afternoon.
OL,10,FThe Naked Fish restaurant, on Queen
OL,11,FStreet, said customers and staff were
OL,12,Fevacuated safely, and the people living
OL,13,Fin the flats above were also reported
OL,14,Fsafe.
OL,16,FThe family-run business, which
OL,17,Foverlooks the harbour, said it was
OL,18,F"absolutely devastated" by the blaze.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
