OL,3,GNEWSA'Devastating' fire at fish and
OL,4,Achip shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FHumberside Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,7,Fthey were called at about 14:45 BST to
OL,8,Fa fire involving an extractor fan which
OL,9,Fwas put out by crews using a thermal
OL,10,Fimaging camera.
